This test doesn't actually assert that navigation occurred after clicking the primary-field link; it only re-checks the existing `links.length`. Update it to assert an observable navigation outcome (e.g., render the detail route in the same router and expect `metadata-detail-page`/schema widgets, or assert the location/pathname change).
```suggestion
      // Should navigate to the object detail route and render detail-only UI
      await waitFor(() => {
        expect(screen.getByTestId('metadata-detail-page')).toBeDefined();
        expect(screen.getByTestId('field-management-section')).toBeDefined();
```
